/Title (The proposed Global Fuel Prices and Taxation Trends BI solution addresses the challenge of exploring fuel-price and policy-context data across countries, regions, years and fuel types. The completed design specifies the customer problem, requirements, architecture, data-preparation workflow, eight business questions, three dashboards, a story sequence and a validation plan. Final empirical conclusions must be added after loading the source dataset, executing quality checks and validating the Tableau outputs.)
